    [*] --> Capabilities : save OK, generation G1
    Capabilities --> AskServer : capabilities loaded
    Capabilities --> CapsMasked : capabilities fetch failed
    CapsMasked --> EditorRetry : looks like a hard no
    AskServer --> TicketBusy : another check in flight
    TicketBusy --> EditorRetry : old identity kept, poll may stall
    AskServer --> PrepFailed : status fetch failed or offline
    AskServer --> AlreadyPublished : server phase published
    AskServer --> CloudOnly : recipe or thermal or storage
    AskServer --> ServerNeedsAttention : server phase needs_attention
    AskServer --> Preparing : awaiting_device, new identity
    AskServer --> LocalReady : same identity, file kept

    Preparing --> Superseded : server no longer current
    Preparing --> BlipFailed : isCurrent check offline
    Preparing --> Rendering : clips resolved
    Preparing --> NeedsAttention : clip missing or too long
    Rendering --> LocalReady : export finished and checked
    Rendering --> Backgrounded : app suspended
    Rendering --> NeedsAttention : export failed
    Rendering --> Cancelled : you tap Stop rendering
    Rendering --> Killed : app killed
    Backgrounded --> NeedsAttention : export error, reported
    BlipFailed --> NeedsAttention : reported as failure
    Killed --> Preparing : you reopen the project, recover
    Killed --> Reaped : never reopened for 24h

    LocalReady --> Superseded : server moved on
    LocalReady --> Syncing : still current
    Syncing --> Synced : publish accepted
    Syncing --> Superseded : publish says superseded
    Syncing --> LocalReady : upload failed, retry without render
    LocalReady --> EditorRetry : sync error shown (7457)

    Synced --> EditorReady : variant ready and identity matches
    AlreadyPublished --> EditorReady : variant ready
    Superseded --> [*] : newer save owns the phone

    NeedsAttention --> EditorRetry : editor poll sees it
    ServerNeedsAttention --> EditorRetry : editor poll sees it
    CloudOnly --> EditorRetry : editor poll sees it
    Cancelled --> EditorRetry : editor poll sees it
    PrepFailed --> EditorRetry : editor poll sees it
    Reaped --> EditorRetry : open project
    EditorRetry --> ServerRetry : Retry, server said needs attention
    EditorRetry --> Capabilities : Retry, phone-side problem (7435)
    ServerRetry --> AskServer : new identity, recipe revision +1
    ServerRetry --> EditorRetry : retry call failed
    EditorReady --> [*]

